115	<h1>Worker skill changes</h1>
116	<p class="standfirst">What changed in the workers' skill that you have not read: eleven changes in six files, nine from the landing of climb batch 27 and two after it, each as a diff of the skill&rsquo;s current text with its reason.</p>
117	</header>
